# Airwarm website — things that should never be committed.

# Operating-system and editor clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# There is no build step, no package manager and no toolchain in this
# project. If any of these ever appear, something has gone wrong: this site
# must stay as plain HTML and CSS so it deploys to GitHub Pages as-is and can
# be edited without installing anything.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
dist/
build/
.cache/

# Local previews and scratch files
*.log
.env
.env.*
_local/
_scratch/

# Working copies of source material. The Airwarm business pack is
# confidential — financial assumptions, pay scenarios, the risk register and
# funding terms. None of it belongs in this public-facing repository. Only
# approved website copy and the brand colour tokens have been used here.
Airwarm/
airwarm-pack/
*.docx
*.pdf
